<title>USA: Best Buy off on weak October, Q3 outlook.</title>
<headline>Best Buy off on weak October, Q3 outlook.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Best Buy Co Inc fell 3-1/4 to 13 after the retailer reported lower October same-store sales and projected third-quarter earnings would be below the year-ago level.</p>
<p>Analysts said Best Buy's weak October performance drove down the stock and reflected a broad decline in consumer electronics retailing.</p>
<p>&quot;It is symptomatic of a broader trend,&quot; said Edward Lee, a Robertson Stephens analyst.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
